      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/clifford_michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Unlike many Michigan towns, Clifford sits entirely within Burlington Township and contains no major rivers, lakes, or prominent natural landmarks.",
